Rule 15 (if other is complex dtype, then input should be float or complex dtype)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if (dtype_(v_2) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 10) then (dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 10)
>>
Rule 16 (if input is complex dtype, then other should be float or complex dtype)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if (dtype_(v_1) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 10) then (dtype_(v_2) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 8 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 10)
>>
Rule 17 (If one tensor is complex128, the other cannot be float16)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 10 then dtype_(v_2) ≠ 6 else if dtype_(v_2) = 10 then dtype_(v_1) ≠ 6
